<item>
<title>Pakistan and Afghanistan: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/afghanistan-pakistan/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-afghanistan-pakistan-2026-10-13T00:53:25.656Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 13 Oct 2026 00:53:25 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Pakistani security forces continue to face cross-border attacks, with recent landmine blasts killing four men near the LoC in Azad Kashmir and another four Pakistani infiltrators killed in a blast in Jammu and Kashmir's Poonch district. Afghan Taliban fighters are accused of using Afghan soil to launch attacks into Pakistan, prompting Pakistan to urge the Taliban to stop such cross-border militant activity. A blasphemy allegation sparked an attack on a Christian family’s home and clinic in Pakistan, while the Taliban are exploiting European anti-migrant sentiment. The conflict remains deadly, with 1,794 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.com/2026/10/12/world/asia/europe-taliban-deportations-migrants.html&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTE0xRzlPOFFOY1paNVo4NDdkaXRZcGk1Q1d0WUtxd1ZmR1Vod2pibkk1S2JPYVMwQjhzcnMzWWVadWUtTGZqNE5mVw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTE1qLVd4OVhEMmtsWnR3TE5uWFZHd2tKZzk4S0Y4YnAzU2dyckNQcVFTWndQanpoVWc4STFvaGhKYnVRY3B3VFpvbw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Indian Express&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxNeGZqYVRfVm1nN0RPMHBTSEQtOXptVlVfT04wMTRISDUwdU82a1VXcHJuVGl5ckRkeHA5elpOMlpmTkNiQWVQLUhCNjlHRmRLOXhKVkZ5Yi1rVGM2d0ctZVJ2aXVSSER5SnlaOGxDOS11TWJmVFlWNDE1QmhXVGVTb1JmeW0yVk8tanljaURtNC1DVUJONG5pRW9rZjBONVlhdElXOXd6WkZjZDcwMDRHX0FR?oc=5&quot;&gt;Kashmir Observer&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikwFBVV95cUxObnM4T0lhbkdoSW42MkhCYVJPbFlJajBYZ3VMZndvWWV2WGtJVXhWZGNQdVVPZUw1YlpIa2JWbnVYSGhSVnJ3RTFuVlpKYmdDQks5eTN4bVVaTXo1NFpiTThEZjhzbWdpbXMzOGV5TG9FYnFyX1NpcVFnWFhuSDhDcDdIc